SUMMARY: Elvis Tribute Artist: Sam Calleri
DESCRIPTION:This fundraiser for St. Luke’s Anglican Church features Sam Calleri\, a well-known Elvis Tribute Artist (ETA). He has been a prominent fixture in the Elvis tribute community for over a decade\, often placing in the top tiers at local and provincial ETA competitions. Tickets: Adults $20 if purchased in advance\, $25 at the door\, Children 12 and under free  \nCall 416-421-6878 x 21 for tickets or send e-transfer to st.luke@ca.inter.net. Refreshments available for purchase. We have parking and we are accessible.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/elvis-tribute-artist-sam-calleri/
LOCATION:St. Luke’s Anglican Church\, 904 Coxwell Ave.\, Toronto
END:VEVENT
