SUMMARY:Mark Battenberg Music presents The Autumn Concerto: The Chamber Music of Beaches composer/guitarist Mark Battenberg
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for a magical evening of music as we welcome the glorious season of Autumn with the Autumn Concerto\, written and arranged by Beaches own Mark Battenberg. Featuring  fabulous special guests\, Cellist Sybil Shanahan\, Violinist Alex Cheung and Shakuhachi Flute master Debbie Danbrook. A concert you won’t want to miss. Admission is $20 or pay what you can.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/mark-battenberg-music-presents-the-autumn-concerto-the-chamber-music-of-beaches-composer-guitarist-mark-battenberg/
LOCATION:Danforth Mennonite Church\, 2174 Danforth Ave.\, Toronto
END:VEVENT
