SUMMARY:Battle of Britain Remembrance and Opening Ceremony for Legion Week
DESCRIPTION:Royal Canadian Legion Branch 11 invites the community to attend its Battle of Britain Remembrance and opening ceremony for Legion Week on Sunday\, Sept. 20\, at 2 p.m. \nThe event will take place at host Branch 22\, 1240 Woodbine Ave.\, on the main floor. \nThe ceremony will feature music by the Ulster Band\, with a reception to follow. \nVeterans\, Legionnaires\, their partners and spouses\, and members of the community are invited to attend. All are welcome.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/battle-of-britain-remembrance-and-opening-ceremony-for-legion-week/
LOCATION:1240 Woodine Ave. Branch 11\, 1240 Woodbine Avenue\, Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17130700/INVITATION-LW-LEGIONNAIRES-SEPT-20-2026-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Beach Metro Community News
